---
import KineticTitle from '../KineticTitle.astro';
---
<section id="about" class="section about" aria-labelledby="about-title">
  <div class="wrap about__grid">
    <div class="about__head">
      <p class="section__label"><span>01</span> / About</p>
      <KineticTitle id="about-title" text="I learned to build it myself." mode="stretch" class="about__title" />
    </div>
    <div class="about__body" data-reveal>
      <p class="about__lead">Since my teens I've been fascinated by businesses with high-quality websites that actually work. When I needed a site of my own, I learned to build it.</p>
      <p>I watched my family's small businesses run without that professional, next-level touch, and I wanted to give it to them. My first live websites were my mother's, my father's and my own.</p>
      <p>That's still what drives me: I want businesses, people, places and organisations to be represented properly on the internet.</p>
      <dl class="about__facts">
        <div><dt>Studio</dt><dd>Nexus Forge</dd></div>
        <div><dt>First sites</dt><dd>Mum's, Dad's, mine</dd></div>
        <div><dt>I build</dt><dd>Websites, dashboards, custom tools</dd></div>
      </dl>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<style>
  .about__grid { display: grid; gap: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 5rem); grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr); }
  @media (min-width: 900px) { .about__grid { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.1fr) minmax(0, 1fr); align-items: end; } }
  :global(.about__title) { font-size: var(--step-3); max-width: 12ch; }
  .about__body { display: grid; gap: 1.1rem; max-width: 58ch; }
  .about__body p { margin: 0; }
  .about__lead { font-size: var(--step-1); line-height: 1.4; }
  .about__facts { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(150px, 1fr)); gap: 1rem; margin: 1rem 0 0; padding-top: 1.2rem; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .about__facts dt { font-size: var(--step--1); letter-spacing: .14em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--ink-2); }
  .about__facts dd { margin: .2rem 0 0; font-weight: 600; }
</style>
